{"translation":{"id":"fra_jnd","name":"Bible J.N. Darby","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=frajnd","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=frajnd","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"JND","englishName":"French: Bible J.N. Darby","language":"fra","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"121a3f4841e42965f22ebebcf5a8578a12578ec30eaf1ca7ae4e46d5d85ccb80","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31170,"languageName":"français","languageEnglishName":"French"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"fra_jnd","name":"Les Psaumes","commonName":"Les Psaumes","title":"Les Psaumes","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"4c48a766d24644f7ef347ae1395ef8ddb5d363cc30acf1733162d22f071b120e","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2527},"chapter":{"number":20,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"Au chef de musique. Psaume de David.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"Que l’Éternel te réponde au jour de la détresse ! Que le nom du Dieu de Jacob te protège !","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Que du sanctuaire","poem":1},{"noteId":60},{"text":"il envoie ton secours, et que de Sion il te soutienne !","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Qu’il se souvienne de toutes tes offrandes, et qu’il accepte ton holocauste ! Sélah.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Qu’il te donne selon ton cœur, et qu’il accomplisse tous tes conseils !","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Nous triompherons dans ton salut, et nous élèverons nos bannières au nom de notre Dieu. Que l’Éternel accomplisse toutes tes demandes !","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Maintenant je sais que l’Éternel sauve son oint ; il lui répondra des cieux de sa sainteté, par les actes puissants du salut de sa droite.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Ceux-ci font gloire de [leurs] chars, et ceux-là de [leurs] chevaux, mais nous, du nom de l’Éternel, notre Dieu.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Ceux-là se courbent et tombent ; mais nous nous relevons et nous tenons debout.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Éternel, sauve ! Que le roi nous réponde au jour où nous crions.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":60,"caller":"a","text":"ou : lieu saint.","reference":{"chapter":20,"verse":3}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/20.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/21.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/19.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}